{
  "name": "Fired ability \"target X has base power and toughness\" / \"becomes … in addition\" — on the target, not the source",
  "notes": "In a fired ability an effect with no target restriction is taken for the source's own and pinned to it (_pinAbilityEffectsToSource). generalBasePTRegex and addTypeRegex gave a single \"target X\" subject no restriction, so Gigantomancer's \"Target creature you control has base power and toughness 7/7\" made Gigantomancer 7/7 and showed no target dropdown; likewise Neurok Transmuter, Doc Ock and Rootwise Survivor. Both parsers now give every \"target X\" subject its restriction, except one that _addAbilityPseudo wrote for a pronoun as a guess (\"it\" -> \"target Pirate\" from Coercive Recruiter's trigger condition, where the real target is any creature): the pseudo-permanent lists those subjects in _guessedTargetSubjects, saved as guessedTargetSubjects with the fired ability because a restored board re-parses the already rewritten text. A save without the list keeps the old behaviour. Each ability here is fired once with a target and once with none; with none picked the source must stay as printed. Rootwise Survivor also lost \"It gains haste\": haveAbilityRegex measured its overlap with the add-type sentence from the line start instead of from its own sentence. A pronoun after a target the effect names is written out as that target (_abilityTargetBefore, cards-helpers.js), so every parser reads the real target and nothing is left to guess: Coercive Recruiter's \"it\" is \"target creature\" and takes a non-Pirate; Excava's \"It's a 1/1 Spirit creature\" is \"target artifact, creature, or non-Aura enchantment\", takes a creature or an enchantment and is not pinned to Excava when no target is picked. The nearest permanent target before the pronoun is used, past a targeted player (Ms. Bumbleflower: \"target opponent draws a card. Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature. It gains flying\"), and a target named by subtype counts (Admiral Brass: \"target Pirate creature card … It has base power and toughness 4/4. It gains haste\"; Tyvar Kell: \"up to one target Elf … It gains deathtouch\"). Sensei Golden-Tail's \"That creature gains bushido 1 and becomes a Samurai\" needed the numbered keyword read off the add-type subject. Only a pronoun with no target before it is still a guess.",
  "steps": [
    { "add": "Grizzly Bears", "as": "bears" },
    { "add": "Gigantomancer", "as": "gig" },
    { "fire": "@gig", "activated": 0, "as": "firedGig1" },
    { "call": ["setTarget", "@firedGig1", "@bears"] },
    { "fire": "@gig", "activated": 0, "as": "firedGig2" },

    { "add": "Hill Giant", "as": "giant" },
    { "add": "Neurok Transmuter", "as": "neurok" },
    { "fire": "@neurok", "activated": 0, "as": "firedNeurok1" },
    { "call": ["setTarget", "@firedNeurok1", "@giant"] },
    { "fire": "@neurok", "activated": 0, "as": "firedNeurok2" },

    { "add": "Sol Ring", "as": "ring" },
    { "add": "Doc Ock, Evil Inventor", "as": "ock1" },
    { "fire": "@ock1", "trigger": 0, "as": "firedOck1" },
    { "call": ["setTarget", "@firedOck1", "@ring"] },
    { "add": "Doc Ock, Evil Inventor", "as": "ock2" },
    { "fire": "@ock2", "trigger": 0, "as": "firedOck2" },

    { "add": "Forest", "as": "forest" },
    { "add": "Rootwise Survivor", "as": "root1" },
    { "fire": "@root1", "trigger": 1, "as": "firedRoot1" },
    { "call": ["setTarget", "@firedRoot1", "@forest"] },
    { "add": "Rootwise Survivor", "as": "root2" },
    { "fire": "@root2", "trigger": 1, "as": "firedRoot2" },

    { "add": "Silvercoat Lion", "as": "lion" },
    { "add": "Coercive Recruiter", "as": "recruiter" },
    { "fire": "@recruiter", "trigger": 0, "as": "firedRecruiter" },
    { "call": ["setTarget", "@firedRecruiter", "@lion"] },

    { "add": "Runeclaw Bear", "as": "runeclaw" },
    { "add": "Phyrexian Arena", "as": "arena" },
    { "add": "Excava, the Risen Past", "as": "excava1" },
    { "fire": "@excava1", "trigger": 1, "as": "firedExcava1" },
    { "call": ["setTarget", "@firedExcava1", "@runeclaw"] },
    { "add": "Excava, the Risen Past", "as": "excava2" },
    { "fire": "@excava2", "trigger": 1, "as": "firedExcava2" },
    { "call": ["setTarget", "@firedExcava2", "@arena"] },
    { "add": "Excava, the Risen Past", "as": "excava3" },
    { "fire": "@excava3", "trigger": 1, "as": "firedExcava3" },

    { "add": "Eager Cadet", "as": "cadet" },
    { "add": "Ms. Bumbleflower", "as": "bumble" },
    { "fire": "@bumble", "trigger": 1, "as": "firedBumble" },
    { "call": ["setTarget", "@firedBumble", "@cadet"] },

    { "add": "Kari Zev, Skyship Raider", "as": "kari" },
    { "add": "Admiral Brass, Unsinkable", "as": "brass1" },
    { "fire": "@brass1", "trigger": 1, "as": "firedBrass1" },
    { "call": ["setTarget", "@firedBrass1", "@kari"] },
    { "add": "Admiral Brass, Unsinkable", "as": "brass2" },
    { "fire": "@brass2", "trigger": 1, "as": "firedBrass2" },

    { "add": "Llanowar Elves", "as": "elves" },
    { "add": "Tyvar Kell", "as": "tyvar" },
    { "fire": "@tyvar", "activated": 1, "as": "firedTyvar" },
    { "call": ["setTarget", "@firedTyvar", "@elves"] },

    { "add": "Sensei Golden-Tail", "as": "sensei" },
    { "fire": "@sensei", "activated": 1, "as": "firedSensei" },
    { "call": ["setTarget", "@firedSensei", "@elves"] }
  ],
  "asserts": [
    { "perm": "Grizzly Bears", "final": { "power": 7, "toughness": 7 } },
    { "perm": "Gigantomancer", "final": { "power": 1, "toughness": 1 } },
    { "perm": "Hill Giant", "final": { "types": { "$includes": ["Artifact", "Creature"] } } },
    { "perm": "Neurok Transmuter", "final": { "types": { "$excludes": ["Artifact"] } } },
    { "perm": "Sol Ring", "final": { "power": 8, "toughness": 8, "types": { "$includes": ["Creature"] }, "subtypes": { "$includes": ["Robot", "Villain"] } } },
    { "perm": "Doc Ock, Evil Inventor A", "final": { "subtypes": { "$excludes": ["Robot"] } } },
    { "perm": "Doc Ock, Evil Inventor B", "final": { "subtypes": { "$excludes": ["Robot"] } } },
    { "perm": "Forest", "final": { "power": 0, "toughness": 0, "types": { "$includes": ["Land", "Creature"] }, "subtypes": { "$includes": ["Forest", "Elemental"] }, "abilities": { "$includes": ["Haste"] } } },
    { "perm": "Rootwise Survivor A", "final": { "subtypes": { "$excludes": ["Elemental"] } } },
    { "perm": "Rootwise Survivor B", "final": { "subtypes": { "$excludes": ["Elemental"] } } },
    { "perm": "Silvercoat Lion", "final": { "subtypes": { "$includes": ["Cat", "Pirate"] }, "abilities": { "$includes": ["Haste"] } } },
    { "perm": "Coercive Recruiter", "final": { "abilities": { "$excludes": ["Haste"] } } },
    { "perm": "Runeclaw Bear", "final": { "power": 1, "toughness": 1, "subtypes": { "$includes": ["Bear", "Spirit"] }, "abilities": { "$includes": ["Flying"] } } },
    { "perm": "Phyrexian Arena", "final": { "power": 1, "toughness": 1, "types": { "$includes": ["Enchantment", "Creature"] }, "subtypes": { "$includes": ["Spirit"] } } },
    { "perm": "Excava, the Risen Past C", "final": { "power": 3, "toughness": 3 } },
    { "effect": { "source": "Ms. Bumbleflower (trigger)", "layer": "6", "type": "add_ability", "target": "Eager Cadet", "params": { "ability": "Flying" } } },
    { "perm": "Ms. Bumbleflower", "final": { "abilities": { "$excludes": ["Flying"] } } },
    { "perm": "Kari Zev, Skyship Raider", "final": { "power": 4, "toughness": 4, "abilities": { "$includes": ["Haste"] } } },
    { "perm": "Admiral Brass, Unsinkable A", "final": { "power": 3, "toughness": 3, "abilities": { "$excludes": ["Haste"] } } },
    { "perm": "Admiral Brass, Unsinkable B", "final": { "power": 3, "toughness": 3, "abilities": { "$excludes": ["Haste"] } } },
    { "perm": "Llanowar Elves", "final": { "subtypes": { "$includes": ["Elf", "Samurai"] }, "abilities": { "$includes": ["Deathtouch", "Bushido 1"] } } }
  ]
}
